<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Inc CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Inc CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Inc said on Thursday Charles W. Goodyear has resigned as executive vice president and chief financial officer of the company and senior vice president and chief financial officer of Freeport-McMoRan Resource Partners LP.</p>
<p>Effective January 1, the company said, Michael J. Arnold will become senior vice president and chief administrative officer and Robert M. Wohleber will become senior vice president and chief financial officer of both the company and the partnership.</p>
</text>
